abstract: >-
  A local-first scientific literature retrieval system with origin-aware
  evidence-sufficiency certification for reports that may share a study,
  cohort, dataset, trial, or publication family.
keywords:
  - evidence synthesis
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - scientific provenance
  - study overlap
  - malaria
